]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoros are consumed by identity, with any notes under them kept.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]A Pomodoro entry is deleted only when this capture emptied it, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]every removal is visible in the preview before submit.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_star_blocks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/capture_star_blocks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-7n[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-7n/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs contract, grammar, wire names, and vectors[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write the `*` grammar, consumption amendments (PDL8–PDL11), [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire fields, human output, and ST/STP vectors into docs/capture.md, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/task-dependencies.md, docs/completion.md, docs/freshness.md, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README.md before any code.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared capture consumption by identity, keeping notes, and [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]reported[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]consume[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]consume: make every capture consumption path match Task Links by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity, keep authored notes under consumed link bullets, delete only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]entries this capture emptied, and report consumed_links[] plus removed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro_blocks; resolves bob-cli-7l.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Two-direction lexer, Markdown guards, and capture-parse wire[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]parse[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]parse: generalize the `&` scanner to a Blocks direction with the `*` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Markdown guards, carry blocked_tasks[] through the execution and editor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]models, add spans and the blocked_task need, mirror every `&` rejection,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and fix the leading-run bug bob-cli-7m.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Path-addressed existing-dependent writer with star guards[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]writer[dim] · [dim][/dim]after consume[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer: address the existing-dependent writer by vault path plus block [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ID, add the `*` target resolver and A8 guards, the Next cap option, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]always-mint for a new blocker, and relocate-by-ID; `&` stays [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]byte-identical.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Blocked-task completion pool and capture-task-id replacement[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]complete[dim] · [dim][/dim]after parse[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]complete: add the blocked_task completion context with an open-editable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pool ranked today-linked first, already_blocked and disabled_reason [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows, shell completion, and capture-task-id blocked_task_replacement.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Execute `*` captures and report them[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]execute[dim] · [dim][/dim]after parse, writer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]execute: wire parsed blocked_tasks into new-task, sub-bullet, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dependency-only, and forced --task captures in the link-then-consume [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]order, and emit dependency_updates[], minted_blocker_block_id, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human lines, with ST vector tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture direction-aware picker and blocks preview[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after complete, execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: parameterize the dependency picker by direction for `*`, add span [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]kinds, Backspace and Add-ID support, and render dependency_updates[], [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]consumed_links[], and deleted sessions from real-bob fixtures.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decision record and final docs sweep[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]publish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish: write the capture `*` decision record citing the epic's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commits, republish memory, and reconcile the docs' JSON examples with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real output from the final binary.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-7n","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-7n.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fd0f942b4cb278aad2b83599ede6d6eb","started_at":"2026-10-14T15:29:46.488112+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7n","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7n.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7n.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7n.3","bbugyi200.athena.b